{"name":"弹窗","description":"在当前页面上方居中弹出的阻断式对话框，用于聚焦单一核心操作。 · 确认删除、填写短表单或预览内容可在弹窗内完成。它会限制背景操作，因此只用于确实需要集中注意力的任务，并要管理关闭和键盘焦点。","quote":"点击按钮后弹出一个居中窗口，背景变暗，必须确认或关闭后才能继续。。","agentPrompt":"订单页的地址编辑请放进 Modal，打开后焦点进入标题或首个字段，提供保存和关闭；关闭后焦点回到触发按钮。保存一次和按 Esc 关闭一次，确认订单页背景未被误操作且焦点返回正确位置。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-modal\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>弹窗<span>Modal</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">点击按钮后弹出一个居中窗口，背景变暗，必须确认或关闭后才能继续。。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">在当前页面上方居中弹出的阻断式对话框，用于聚焦单一核心操作。</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>确认删除、填写短表单或预览内容可在弹窗内完成。它会限制背景操作，因此只用于确实需要集中注意力的任务，并要管理关闭和键盘焦点。</span></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>弹窗</em><em>模态窗</em><em>对话框</em><em>模态框</em><em>Dialog</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"dm-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:72%\"></i><i style=\"width:88%\"></i><i style=\"width:56%\"></i></div><div class=\"dm-mask\"></div><div class=\"dm-box\"><div class=\"dm-title\">确认删除这个项目？</div><div class=\"dm-line\"></div><div class=\"dm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">确认删除</span></div></div></div><div class=\"demo-live-trigger\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-open-modal>打开交互示例</button><span class=\"hint\">上方为静态示意，点击按钮可查看交互效果</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>订单页的地址编辑请放进 Modal，打开后焦点进入标题或首个字段，提供保存和关闭；关闭后焦点回到触发按钮。保存一次和按 Esc 关闭一次，确认订单页背景未被误操作且焦点返回正确位置。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>危险操作二次确认</b>：删除、清空、解散</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div class=\"mk-modal \"><span class=\"m-title\">确认删除这个项目？</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i>\n      <div class=\"m-actions\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">取消</span><span class=\"mk-btn danger\">确认删除</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>就地填写短表单</b>：例如重命名或新建</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div class=\"mk-modal \"><span class=\"m-title\">重命名项目</span><span class=\"mk-input \">官网改版 v2</span>\n        <div class=\"m-actions\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">取消</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">保存</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>放大看内容</b>：图片预览、详情速览</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene \"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:50%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div class=\"mk-modal \"><span class=\"m-title\">封面预览</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;height:26px;border-radius:4px\"></i>\n        <div class=\"m-actions\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">关闭</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>需要处理才能继续</b>：实名认证、协议签署</div><div class=\"mk \"><div clas